        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Insomniac Events, SBE, Giant\n- People: Sam Nazarian\n- Places: Los Angeles, Hollywood, 1756 Naud Street\n- Venues: Create, Exchange L.A., Factory 93, Vanguard Hollywood\n- Events: White Wonderland\n- Topics: nightclub operations, festival co-organization\n\nFacts:\n- Sam Nazarian was born in 1975.\n- Sam Nazarian is an Iranian-American businessman, investor, and philanthropist.\n- Insomniac Events is involved in operating three Los Angeles nightclubs: Create, Exchange L.A., and Factory 93.\n- Create is operated by Insomniac Events in partnership with SBE.\n- Create was built on the site of the former Vanguard Hollywood.\n- Factory 93 is an underground warehouse located at 1756 Naud Street.\n- White Wonderland is an electronic music festival co-organized by Insomniac Events and Giant.",
